    "title": "Emergency alert triggered at Northwood Technical College turned out to be false alarm - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WEAU Staff ,\n1 days ago RICE LAKE, Wis. (WEAU) - An emergency alert triggered at Northwood Technical College in Rice Lake turned out to be false alarm. According to a spokesperson with Northwood Technical College, there was no incident called in or active threat on campus. An emergency alert was inadvertently triggered during a system test, with the initial alert going out at around 7:16 a.m. Read full article\n1",
